window.products.push({"id":1128017,"name":"SE 2.5\" Small Sink Wire Mesh Drain Cover - SP-SSWA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718ORTJawxL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The SE SP-SSWA 2.5\" Small Sink Wire Mesh Drain Cover catches food, hair, jewelry, soap, and small items and keeps them out of the drain to help prevent clogs. The mesh allows water to pass through and keeps the drain flowing. You can easily set in place or remove the strainer. It is advised to clean the strainers daily by rinsing it and swirling a tissue around to get rid of anything on it.SE is committed to providing the customer with the best source for value possible on the market. You will enjoy the quality, function and usefulness of our SE SP-SSWA 2.5\" Small Sink Wire Mesh Drain Cover.IPR Rights Notice:Important: Avoid getting counterfeit items. Genuine SE products come with the SE logo on the packaging.SE is a registered trademark protected by US Trademark Law.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718ORTJawxL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SE","source_asin":"B00DZTZZBW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1128017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DZTZZBW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DZTZZBW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1128018,"name":"Blissly Weighted Blanket for Kids, 7lbs 41\"x60\", Calming Cooling Organic Cotton/Warm Minky, Premium Glass Beads, for Children Between 70-90 lbs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vbL4eQdQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"♥In our fast-paced hyper-connected world, sleep is at a premium. Unfortunately, it is something many of us are missing out on, and it is especially damaging for our children. In the chaos of our everyday lives, our beds and sleep are one of the treasured sanctuaries we aim to protect. Our weighted Blankets gently embrace your child, providing a sense of calm and security for a restful night's sleep. ♥What is a Weighted Blanket? A drug-free sleep support for adults and children. A weighted blanket is essentially a heavy, quilt-style blanket containing internal pockets filled with (surprise, surprise) weights. Snuggling under one gives your whole body ‘deep touch pressure stimulation’, which is believed to soothe the senses and assist with sleep. ♥Read before Purchasing ◆Adjustment Period: It usually takes about a week to adjust to the blanket. Please give 7-10 days for your body to adjust to the blanket before you can experience the full benefits of the product. ◆Smaller Size: A weighted blanket is usually smaller than a traditional blanket of the same size, which could help to concentrate the weight on your body. ◆For Summer & Winter: Blissly's weighted blanket is suitable for all seasons. With a soft and breathable Cotton side for warmer nights and a cosy 'nubbed' minky side for cooler nights for the most satisfaction in any environment. ◆Refund & Returns: Blissly provides a one-month return and replacement service. ◆Care Instructions: We recommend spot clean and flat dry. Frequent wash would damage the structure of the blanket, so we suggest using a duvet cover for the aim of easy cleaning. ◆Cautions: Do not cover your face with the blanket in case of suffocation. Keep clear of fires, heaters, or any other heat sources. People with health risks should consult your doctor before using weighted blankets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vbL4eQdQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blissly","source_asin":"B081T4211X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1128018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081T4211X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081T4211X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
