window.products.push({"id":1128023,"name":"FINECITY Turquoise Mint Sheer Curtains for Bedroom - Semi Sheer Knitted Lace Curtains 63 Inch Length, Rod Pocket Privacy Sheer Curtains Geometric Wind","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gi2114scS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"READY MADE KNITTED LACE SHEER CURTAINS - Sold as Pair, Measurements: W52” x L63” per panel, W104” x L63” pair (2 panels). Each geometric lace curtain panel features with dual-rod pockets 1.2” + 2.8” which can fit most standard curtain rod. Our mint turquoise lace curtain panel with knitted snow white pattern are an ideal way through which you can decorate any windows in your rooms. E.g. bedroom, girls room, dining room and more… EXQUISITE GEOMETRIC LACE FABRIC - Delicate abstract minimal snow white pattern knitted on mint turquoise lace sheer curtains were designed to be artistic yet familiar for room decor that wouldn’t feel out of place in either modern or country home. LIGHTWEIGHT & SEMI TRANSPARENT LACE SHEER CURTAINS - These lace sheer curtains adopt lightweight crochet lace fabric that allows lots of natural light into the room. Our lace sheer curtains also lead an airy feel indoors, and adds to the elegant atmosphere of a contemporary-inspired decor. CARE INSTRUCTIONS - These mint turquoise sheer curtains 63 inch long are Machine Washable in Cold Water; Tumble Dry Low; Cool Iron If Needed; Do Not Bleach. FINECITY geometric turquoise mint sheer lace curtains with abstract minimal snow white pattern ideal layering pieces for added privacy and light control.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gi2114scS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FINECITY","source_asin":"B09636GL2D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1128023","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09636GL2D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09636GL2D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1128024,"name":"Swissmar Belle 8-Inch Salt Mill, Chocolate Beechwood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":50.72,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CmT9xbh5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Fresh tastes better! Grind with confidence and choose a Swissmar Mill. Swissmar mills are versatile and feature a multi-purpose hard ceramic grinding mechanism designed to grind: pepper, salt, dried herbs and spices. The Swissmar assortment offers a wide range of materials, colors and finishes for you to choose from. To use your Swissmar mill, unscrew the top nut, remove the mill head and fill the reservoir with dry peppers, salts and spices. Grind contents by holding the mill body steady and turning the head in a clockwise direction. Tighten or loosen the top nut to adjust your grind from powdery fine to extra course.The Belle Salt mill is 8 \" tall, and made of elegant Chocolate Beechwood. Ceramic mechanism comes with a 10 year warranty against manufacturing/materials defect.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CmT9xbh5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Swissmar","source_asin":"B008QV8SX6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1128024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008QV8SX6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008QV8SX6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
