window.products.push({"id":1128201,"name":"Dyna-Glo EG10000DH Dual Heat 10,000W Electric Garage Heater, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":472.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s6l7GIRgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Dyna-Glo Dual Heat 10000W Electric Garage Heater is the ideal heating solution for your garage, warehouse, or workshop. This unit includes multiple heat and timer settings as well as a 'fan only' setting, all easily controlled by remote control and displayed on the LED touch screen. The heater provides 25, 589 and 34, 121 BTUs while efficiently heating areas up 1, 000 sq. ft. To ensure safety this heater was designed with overheat protection and a caution indicator light.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s6l7GIRgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dyna-Glo","source_asin":"B07KLF7DW6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1128201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KLF7DW6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KLF7DW6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
