window.products.push({"id":1128266,"name":"3 Gallon Portable Ash Bucket Flexible Wood Handle Indoor & Outdoor Hearth Tools for Fireplace - Fire Pits - Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-aGssIXeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ The Ash Bucket is an essential and practical fireplace accessory. Constructed from steel, the bucket features a raised bottom and thermal insulation to prevent the ashes from heating up the floor, and the metal handle has a wooden grip for comfortable carrying. Equipped with a tight-fitting lid to keep the ash contained, it's an easy solution for maintaining your fireplace, wood burning stove, or fire pit When in use, bucket should be placed on hearth, stone, slate, or brick, as the steel construction insulates the heat, but surface area will still be hot. Ash bucket is made of high quality galvanized iron material with black powder coating to ensure it is fireproof and durable for long-term using. Features: ★ Color: Black ★ Material: Iron ★ Product weight: 3 lbs. ★ Product overall dimension: 10.5''D x 10.5''W x 13.4''H ★ It can also be used for the transfer and removal of burning charcoal when grilling. ★ The fireplace ash bucket with a lid comes with a tight-fitting, lightweight iron/steel lid with a bronze finish, ★ Easy to Carry: This double-bottomed ash bucket holds three gallons of warm ash safely, so you can use it with peace of mind. ★ Enough Capacity: The large 3-gallon capacity capacity can easily store or transfer wood ashes. Suitable for fire pit, fireplace, wood burner. Of course,","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-aGssIXeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JN","source_asin":"B08X46JHQ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1128266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X46JHQ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X46JHQ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
