window.products.push({"id":1128477,"name":"HomeCosmo Gold & White Marble Coasters for Drinks, Brass-Inlay (Set of 4), 100% Natural Stone Coasters Set, Hand-cut by Artisans, Protect Furniture fr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k4mRHvyIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Set of 4 Natural Marble Coasters goes well with all types of furniture or kitchen tops, that's the beauty of natural marble. Be it a wooden table or a glass table or accent; they look beautiful everywhere. They are also weatherproof and can be kept outside on Pool Side tables or Outside tables. What sets our coasters apart from others on the market? HomeCosmo takes great pride in the way we individually sand the edges of each of all our natural stone coasters. Unsealed stone table coasters that actually absorb water! While non-skid feet help keep the coasters in place on your table. Most stone coasters that you see have a marble polish applied. The polish makes it, so the water does not soak in, not the best idea when making a coaster. We believe your coaster should be beautiful and functional. HomeCosmo White marble table coaster also features beautiful veining, and each piece is unique. Due to the natural nature of the stone, each piece will have its unique veining and marbling, and no two coasters are the same! These make stunning gifts and also can be used as decorative trays around the house for candles and more. They all come with foam dots at the bottoms to prevent scratching to furniture and easy handling. These coasters are made to fit even the most massive sized mug. They are functional, while also decorative. Not feeling like using them as coasters? Use them as trays instead!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k4mRHvyIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomeCosmo","source_asin":"B07KY3Y8BC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1128477","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KY3Y8BC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KY3Y8BC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
