window.products.push({"id":1128521,"name":"Atlas Pasta Machine Deluxe Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51C62rDWvnL._AC_.jpg","description":"Finally a set that brings the very best sellers of Atlas Marcato at a great price to you! The Atlas 150 Wellness Pasta machine, plus the popular ravioli attachment to make deliciously filled ravioli (imagine ricotta, squash, shrimp, crab, lamb stew, all these fillings and more!). Also included is the easy to use motor that just takes all the hardwork off of making pasta at home. Just attach the motor to your Atlas pasta machine and there you have a motorized unit that will effortlessly produce the pasta for you!. And the super practical and bestselling TACAPASTA drying rack to hang your wonderful creations to dry. Once you dry your pasta, you can keep it on top of your refrigerator at room temperature for about 2 months. The TACAPASTA as well as all products of this set are original and made by Atlas Marcato of Italy . A $300+ value at a great price! Don't settle for copies! Ask only for the original!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51C62rDWvnL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Atlas Marcato Italy","source_asin":"B005CYST4S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1128521","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005CYST4S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005CYST4S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1128522,"name":"Howard Miller Whitewater Wall-Clocks, Warm Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":283.68,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KwybZypyL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Whitewater Wall Clock by Howard Miller will make a statement on any wall of your home. The inner and outer rings and spade-style hands on the clock are finished in a warm gray iron. The metal gear wall clock in antique brass-finish has applied Roman numerals that match the cast iron gears. The visible gear assembly is not operational but adds a unique and functional sense of style to the timepiece. This accent wall clock with gears works on Quartz, battery-operated movement. Mount it on your favorite wall to add a sophisticated yet antique touch to your home or office.Howard C. Miller founded the company back in 1926, at the age of 21, and is based out of Zeeland, Michigan. Even though Howard Miller understood the need to create products that would be steeped in quality and value, he expected nothing less than the best. From gaining the title \"World's Largest Grandfather Clock Manufacturer\" in the 1960s to creating collectors' cabinets in 1989, all the products have the same attention to detail and handcrafted ideals. We offer hundreds of items to complement any décor ranging from portable alarm clocks to desk sets to wall and mantel clocks to collectors' cabinets to limited edition grandfather clocks. You will always have the same condition that Howard C. Miller provided when he began offering clocks more than 70 years ago: that quality is reflected both in the products we create.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KwybZypyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B091J9R6V9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1128522","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091J9R6V9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091J9R6V9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
