window.products.push({"id":1128585,"name":"Olumoon Memory Foam Pillows, Bed Pillow for Sleeping, Cervical Pillow for Neck Pain, Orthopedic Contour Neck Pillow with Pillowcase, Neck Support Pill","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712SL8l-T6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Contour Memory Foam Pillow】 - The Olumoon neck pillow featured the size of 23.6×14.6×4.7 inches. The innovative contoured, cervical design and memory foam cradles the natural curvature of your neck, this bed pillow provides welcome relief while sleeping. Improve sleeping and Relief the pain of neck and shoulders. It also does help to reduce snoring, enjoy your good sleeping.Suitable for all posture sleepers(side, back and stomach). 【Pain-Relief Neck Support】 - Ergonomic designed with tube wave shape of this slow rebound orthopedic pillow, offers proper support for spine alignment, neck, head and shoulders, but NOT compress auricle like other common pillows. With its personalized 2 height sides-3.9inches/4.7inches in a pillow, you can choose the position that you feel comfortable on this cervical pillow.Relieve & release muscles and physical and mental pressure.Achieve a healthy sleep, waking up in the morning without pain. 【Breathable Skin-friendly Pillowcase】 - Removable and washable pillowcase for this orthopedic pillow adopt unique stitching design and bring you more convenience. Ultra soft and breathable skin-friendly fabric makes you experience a nautral sleep all night. The mesh fabric design makes your bed pillow more breathable and favorable. 【Safety Material】 - Made of 100% high quality memory foam, which is skin-friendly and breathable, this pillow for sleeping Rebound within 3-5 seconds when no press. With the natual pillow curve, this contour pillow allows your head and neck adjust to the pillow easily and naturally while you sleep.Enjoy your sleep all night. 【Best Gift Choice】 - Olumoon pillow provides good solution for cervical vertebrae problems and Worry-Free shopping experience service for customers, you can choose this Cervical Pillow for you and your family with confidence. If for any reason you're not satisfied with the cooling pillow, please feel free to contact us. We offer 24-month product worry-free and friendly customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712SL8l-T6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Olumoon","source_asin":"B0BG1F8GJX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1128585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG1F8GJX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG1F8GJX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
