window.products.push({"id":1128691,"name":"Champagne Ice Bucket, Wine Chiller Ice Mold, Bucket Ice Mold, Diy Kinds of Ice Buckets You Like, Easily Make a Variety of Exquisite Champagne Wine Buc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610xgxWL+kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ICE MODEL ART - You can use the champagne ice model to decorate it by adding fruits, leaves, flowers, edible pigments, or anything else, and make an amazing unique ice bucket for your party. MAKE CHAMPAGNE ICE BUCKET - Open the plastic mold, put your decorations such as flowers, add water, and finally cover the plastic lid. Put in the refrigerator frozen layer. And need to be placed horizontally. Wait for 12 to 24 hours after freezing. Take it out, and then wait for 5-10 minutes at the normal temperature to take out the ice barrel smoothly. Put the gray base in the stainless steel barrel first. Put the ice bucket into the stainless steel barrel. Finally put in champagne. SUITABLE FOR VARIOUS CHAMPAGNE AND OCCASIONS - Applicable to Most Champagne, Wine, Whiskey, Vodka, Cocktails, and Fruit Drinks. According to Different Occasions: Friends' Gathering, Birthday Parties, Various Outdoor Dinners, Family Dinner, Special Holiday Dinners, Valentine's Day, Commemorative Day Dinners, and Important Party Occasions, You Customize the Champagne Ice Bucket Suitable for Various Occasions. DERIVED FROM QUALITY MATERIALS - Plastic ice bucket molds use quality low-temperature resistance raw materials. the freezing process is not easy to crack and is solid and durable. Stainless steel barrels are made of quality raw materials to make solid durability, and not easy to rust. THOUGHTS AND PREPARATION MATERIALS - Prepare your decorative materials in advance such as flowers, fruits, jams, leaves, edible pigments, sand, etc. Anything you can think of can be used for decoration. Tip: If you want to make ice clearer, you can use boiled water. Use it to use it after normal temperature. Or use filtered water or pure water directly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610xgxWL+kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BVYRHEVV","source_asin":"B0BV6KG3K8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1128691","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV6KG3K8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV6KG3K8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
