window.products.push({"id":1128698,"name":"Percale Weave Bed Sheet Sets - Luxurious 100% Cotton Deep Pocket Sheets - 300 Thread Count Bedding Set Includes One Flat Sheet, One Fitted Sheet & Two","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Hg1mfZ44L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"What is Percale? Percale stands for the weaving process in which the fabric is woven by. In percale the yarns are woven in one over one, unlike Sateen where it's four over one. The one over one (percale) weave create a much even, stronger, denser & softer fabric, which can stand the test of time and gets better and better feel the more you wash it. It's just like your favorite old shirt, the more it's laundered the softer and durable it gets. Why Egyptian Cotton? These sheets are woven in the best and authentic way in the world with 100% Egyptian cotton. It's not just cotton grown in Egypt - it is a particular type of long-staple cotton originally grown along the Nile. These are some of the most luxurious and comfortable sheets in the world and will drastically improve the quality of your sleep. Twin Extra Long 3-PC Sheet Set Includes: 1-Twin XL Flat Sheet 70x102\", 1-Twin XL Fitted sheet 39x80\", 1-Pillow case 20x30\" each Full 4-PC Sheet Set Includes: 1-Full Flat Sheet 80x94\", 1-Full Fitted Sheet 54x76\", 2-Standard Pillow cases 20x30\" each Queen 4-PC Sheet Set Includes: 1-Queen Flat Sheet 92x102\", 1-Queen Fitted Sheet 60x80\", 2-Standard Pillow cases 20x30\" each King 4-PC Sheet Set Includes: 1-King Flat Sheet 110x102\", 1-King Fitted Sheet 78x80\", 2-King Pillow cases 20x40\" each California King 4-PC Sheet Set Includes: 1-Cal King Flat Sheet 110x102\", 1-Cal King Fitted Sheet 72x84\", 2-Pillow Cases 20x40\" each","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Hg1mfZ44L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ExceptionalSheets","source_asin":"B00UY1FINY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1128698","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UY1FINY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UY1FINY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
