window.products.push({"id":1128890,"name":"Stepdiy Black Valance, Sequin Black Window Valance,Window Treatment Valances for Living Room，Kitchen & Bedroom, 52\" x 16\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Iv5q2OavL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[New Material] Made of sequin mesh fabric. Bling and eye-catching! It offers a glittering effect in the lamplight or sunlight, add a very luxurious and gorgeous touch to your room. [Home and Holiday Decoration] The decorative valance is perfect for home decor, could be used alone to brighten living room windows, kitchen windows or dining room windows. As a bling and glittering valance, it is also suitable for holiday decoration. The bling sequin valance will add a warm and holiday mood to your room.Perfect for Christmas and other special holiday. [Size] The black valances for windows measures 52\" x 16\" and has a 2” rod pocket.Please confirm the size and quantity that you need according to size of window. [Workmanship]Round sequins are densely woven on the mesh fabric.(Warm Tips: Because of the characteristic of sequin fabric, some sequins fall out when cutting and sewing,it is normal, not quality problem.Please shake off the Shed sequins outside when take valance out from package ) [Washing Instructions] Hand wash it carefully with mild soapy water, then press the valance between dry towel to remove water and dry flat.Do not bleach, Do not tumble,Do not dry clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Iv5q2OavL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stepdiy","source_asin":"B09334T7TJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1128890","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09334T7TJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09334T7TJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1128891,"name":"Jean Dubost 4 Cheese Knives in Box, Ivory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G5n92HkhL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"The Laguiole knife has been used in the south of France for over 200 years. Jean Dubost's family, inspired by the traditional peasant tool, has been crafting the artisan blades since 1920. Surrounded by legend and myth, the Laguiole knife still carries the mark of its ancestors. A bee that is found engraved on all Laguiole products, was originally part of Napoleon Bonaparte's imperial seal. Local legend states it was bestowed upon the Laguiole village as a token of Napoleon's gratitude for the townspeople's courage during his many battles. Others insist that the bee represents the knife's reliability. The blade, made of high-grade stainless steel, is stamped, then ground and then polished in over 25 different manual production stages. Soft and subtle to the touch, a Laguiole knife will stay sharp and will never rust. Recently, the Laguiole mark has expanded to include flatware, wine waiters and cutlery crafted with the same quality and craftsmanship. Trusted and revered in kitchens and restaurants through-out France, the Dubost family is happy for the Laguiole tradition to finally reach this side of the Atlantic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G5n92HkhL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jean Dubost","source_asin":"B001DEN4E6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1128891","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001DEN4E6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001DEN4E6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
