window.products.push({"id":1128923,"name":"North Fork Rugged Heavy Duty Waxed Canvas Firewood Log Carrier Bag Tote – Unique Dual Handles Allow Secure Comfortable Grip with Various Load Sizes. C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917DvqUsi5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The North Fork Rugged Ware Firewood Carrier is all you will need for years of transporting firewood and large logs. This classic designed heavy duty log carrier is precision constructed using premium 16 ounce waxed canvas and is made to withstand a lifetime of rigorous use. Reinforced high quality cotton webbing is hand stitched throughout the entire circumference of our log carrier ensuring no weak points that are prone to ripping as is common in cheaper bags. With the added center cinch, and unique one-handed buckle, logs stay in place when you set down and pickup the your carrier. Dual comfort stitched handles allow various load sizes to be carried with comfort and ease. Long handles allow large loads to be bundled together, while an additional new set of shorter handles allows kids and adults as well, to get a better handle on smaller loads. Maintenance and Care : Like you, our waxed canvas log carrier is tough. No need to baby it or give it much care. Use it as needed and it will stand the test of time. If some unsightly spots develop, simply scrub with a soft bristle brush using mild soap and warm water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917DvqUsi5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"North Fork Rugged","source_asin":"B07P5HFKYX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1128923","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P5HFKYX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P5HFKYX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
