window.products.push({"id":1128965,"name":"GE AHM06LW 19\" Energy Star Qualified Window Air Conditioner with 6,150 BTU Cooling Capacity","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZeBlC395L._AC_SL1409_.jpg","description":"GE is renowned in the household appliance and air conditioning industries. As pioneers in the industry, they are always looking to bring new technology and innovative products to the consumer. GE has a wide selection of Energy Star Rated air conditioners for consumers, helping you lower your household's energy consumption. Comfort is number one for General Electric products. GE appliances have been a part of American households for generations! The AHM06LW features 6150 BTUs of cool air, and is packed with features for a compact unit. It is perfect for your smaller sized room, up to about 250 sq. ft. It is an Energy Star Rated unit with a 12.1 EER and a 12.1 CEER and has convenient, easy to use features such as an electronic thermostat and a remote control. It is energy efficient and economically sound. Included on this compact air conditioner unit is 3 cooling and 3 fan speeds. The AHM series offers an energy saver mode to further enhance your savings. To remind you to clean the filter, the AHM series has a filter reminder light. The filter on the AHM06LW is a one-touch lift-out filter, making it easy to clean and maintain. A clean filter helps to keep your unit running at the optimal performance level further enhancing its efficiency. It also has a 24 hour on/off timer giving you the option to set your unit to turn on before you arrive home. By using the on/off timer, your space is cool and welcoming when you walk in the door and there is no need to blast the air conditioner, ultimately saving energy. It is offered in a white finish for a clean look in any window. It uses a standard household 115V outlet for your convenience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZeBlC395L._AC_SL1409_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GE","source_asin":"B06XSBFVL4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1128965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XSBFVL4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XSBFVL4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
